      "cause": "The update changed no migration, so nothing used the database before the smoke. Aurora had auto-paused (0 ACU); the login, the first database-backed call, met a resuming cluster. MediaApi logged a 10.7 s request ending in http 503 (application_error); capacity read 1.0 ACU a moment later. The smoke made one attempt per check.",
